      "Start by defining the funnel for your specific business, because the path from stranger to customer differs wildly between a restaurant in Yaba and a B2B software vendor. For most consumer businesses: discovery happens on Instagram, TikTok or Google search; consideration happens on your WhatsApp Business catalogue and Instagram grid; purchase happens in DMs, on WhatsApp, or at your physical location; retention happens through broadcast lists and repeat-purchase offers. Map where prospects drop off today — most businesses discover they have plenty of attention but no system for converting it.",
